MATRIX: Collatz hailstone. Tracks steps and peak, then reports the longest chain.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE steps WITH n
  BUGATTI count EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE n IS NOT THE SAME AS 1
    IF n MODULO 2 IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
      BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL floor WITH n DIVIDED BY 2
    OTHERWISE YOU ARE A BETA
      BUGATTI n EQUALS 3 TIMES n PLUS 1
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI count EQUALS count PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT count
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE peak WITH n
  BUGATTI best EQUALS n
  GRIND WHILE n IS NOT THE SAME AS 1
    IF n IS GREATER THAN best THEN
      BUGATTI best EQUALS n
    PERIOD
    IF n MODULO 2 IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
      BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL floor WITH n DIVIDED BY 2
    OTHERWISE YOU ARE A BETA
      BUGATTI n EQUALS 3 TIMES n PLUS 1
    PERIOD
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT best
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI start EQUALS 1
BUGATTI hardest EQUALS 1
BUGATTI hardeststeps EQUALS 0

GRIND WHILE start IS LESS THAN 26
  BUGATTI s EQUALS CALL steps WITH start
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI start PLUS " takes " PLUS s PLUS " steps, peak " PLUS CALL peak WITH start
  IF s IS GREATER THAN hardeststeps THEN
    BUGATTI hardest EQUALS start
    BUGATTI hardeststeps EQUALS s
  PERIOD
  BUGATTI start EQUALS start PLUS 1
STOP GRINDING

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "Longest below 26: " PLUS hardest PLUS " (" PLUS hardeststeps PLUS " steps)"

BACK TO THE MATRIX
